---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - The Neural Chef" description="Privacy policy, cookie disclosures, and data protection guidelines.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-slate-800 py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p class="text-slate-655 italic">
        Last updated: October 24, 2026
      </p>

      <p>
        At <strong>The Neural Chef</strong>, we take the privacy of our visitors seriously. This Privacy Policy documents the types of personal information that is received and collected by our website and how it is used.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Google Analytics 4 (GA4) & Log Files</h2>
        <p>
          We use <strong>Google Analytics 4 (GA4)</strong>, a web analysis service provided by Google LLC, to monitor, understand, and optimize visitor engagement across our recipes.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          GA4 collects pseudo-anonymized data, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
          <li>Pages and recipes viewed, time spent on pages, and scroll depth.</li>
          <li>Approximate geographic location (country/city level; IP addresses are automatically anonymized and discarded by Google without storage).</li>
          <li>Technical parameters such as device model, browser type, operating system, and screen resolution.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Google Analytics stores first-party cookies (e.g., <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code>) on your browser to differentiate user sessions. This data is retained for 14 months and is used exclusively for statistical reporting. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking across all websites by installing the official <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-600 hover:underline">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          We use cookies to store information about visitors' preferences, to record user-specific information on which pages the user accesses or visits, and to personalize or customize our web page content based on visitors' browser type or other information that the visitor sends via their browser.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Third-Party Advertising & Future Ad Networks</h2>
        <p>
          We may partner with third-party advertising networks, such as Google AdSense, to serve advertisements when you visit our website. These companies may use cookies and web beacons to collect non-personally identifiable information (such as your IP address, browser type, or browsing activity) to serve relevant advertisements based on your prior visits to this website and other sites across the Internet.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to our website or other sites.</li>
          <li>Users can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-600 hover:underline">Ads Settings</a> or via <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-600 hover:underline">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Amazon Affiliate Program Links</h2>
        <p>
          We participate in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program. Clicking on our affiliate storefront links allows Amazon to drop tracking cookies on your device to associate any subsequent purchases with our referrer account. These cookies are governed by Amazon's respective privacy policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Consent & Data Management</h2>
        <p>
          We only deploy non-essential cookies (such as personalized advertising or tracking cookies) if you actively consent to them via our Cookie Banner. You have the right to withdraw or modify your consent at any time by clearing your browser's cookies or local storage.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">6. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions or suggestions regarding our Privacy Policy or data handling, please contact us at <a href="mailto:theneuralchef@gmail.com" class="text-cyan-600 hover:underline font-semibold">theneuralchef@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
